WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:02.780
- Hello everyone and
welcome to this bonus video

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:04.230
here on Firm Learning.

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.750
And the reason that I do this video

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:08.180
is that a couple of
days ago it was actually

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:11.570
my one year anniversary
of doing this channel.

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.910
I uploaded the first video on this channel

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:16.650
on January 17th of 2020,

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:19.780
and since then the growth
for sure surprised me.

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:22.500
So, I got over 75,000 subscribers

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.560
in the first year of doing
this channel here on YouTube.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:27.837
So, over the last months I
got several people asking me,

00:00:27.837 --> 00:00:29.417
"Okay Heinrich, how did you do it?

00:00:29.417 --> 00:00:30.297
"How does it work?

00:00:30.297 --> 00:00:31.617
"Do you have any insights

00:00:31.617 --> 00:00:34.240
"on how to grow your
YouTube channel faster?"

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.410
So in this video, I will show
you the actual real back end

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:39.730
of my YouTube analytics of Firm Learning.

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:41.880
I will show you how
the growth looked like,

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:43.580
how it happened over time,

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.670
and I trust there are some good learnings

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:46.900
to be drawn from that.

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:49.190
And even if you don't have
your own YouTube channel

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:52.080
and are also not interested
in starting one anytime soon,

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.170
I do believe it is very
worthwhile to understand

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:56.320
this whole system better
to understand a bit better

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.270
how YouTube actually works,

00:00:58.270 --> 00:00:59.850
how it promotes the videos,

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:01.380
how this growth actually happens.

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:02.410
So, hang in here with me,

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:03.770
I promise there are some good learnings

00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:04.860
to be taken out from this.

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:06.260
So, welcome to another coffee break

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:07.830
here on my channel Firm Learning.

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:09.770
My name is Heinrich and on my channel

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:11.830
I want to help you to become successful

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:13.700
in the first years of your career.

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:16.060
But, before we look
into the backend, guys,

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:17.380
I need to ask you something.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:18.440
I do not understand this.

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:19.850
As you know, I do my very best

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:22.540
to answer every single
comment that you write me,

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:23.800
but for whatever reason,

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:27.040
pretty much since the very
start of this channel,

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:31.010
I keep getting this comment,
"Get into the choppa."

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:33.330
Guys, what are you even talking about?

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:34.320
What is this all about?

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:35.153
I don't get it.

00:01:35.153 --> 00:01:37.890
Whatever guys, let's now jump
into the YouTube analytics

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:39.290
and let's check it out.

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:41.800
This is my YouTube analytics backend.

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:42.980
This is what I see

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:45.200
if I look into the
statistics of my channel.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.850
And now I wanted to show
you the channel statistics

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:49.390
from the very beginning,

00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:52.080
because even though the
first video that I published,

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:54.330
I believe it was on January 17th,

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:57.450
I already made this channel
quite some time before.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:01.020
I believe apparently here
it was in May 28th of 2018.

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:02.810
And the reason was that at that time,

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:04.290
already I had the idea

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:06.300
that maybe at some point in the future

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:07.990
I wanted to do something like that,

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:10.670
I wanted to talk about
consulting contents like that.

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:12.650
And around this time I also created

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:15.590
this slide writing course
that some of you maybe know.

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:17.110
If you don't know it, check it out,

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:18.620
I'll link in the video description.

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:20.350
So, I had the idea maybe
let me make something

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:22.390
bigger out of it, a bigger platform,

00:02:22.390 --> 00:02:26.400
and this was why I created
this YouTube channel initially.

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:29.600
In the beginning, I uploaded
one video to this channel.

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.100
It was, I believe, a
snippet from this course.

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:34.200
I didn't do any advertisement or whatever.

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:36.440
And here you can see that
pretty much just randomly

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:39.260
by YouTube promoting this one video,

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:44.260
I got 267 views and a
total of three subscribers.

00:02:45.050 --> 00:02:47.000
So, was pretty much starting from zero

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.620
when on January 17th I
was starting the channel,

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:51.200
uploading the real video.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:54.180
So, let's now look into the
growth really month by month,

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:56.650
how all of this looked like.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:03:01.650
So, let me now select as a
starting point January of 2020,

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:04.650
because this is when this really started

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:07.750
when I just started uploading the videos.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:11.260
So, this is now the month that
is selected, January, 2020.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:12.570
So, what you can see here indeed

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:15.610
that on January 17th
I uploaded two videos,

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:17.120
so a little introduction,

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:19.010
and then a first video here.

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:21.400
And since then I pretty much started

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:24.810
doing one video every single month.

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:29.170
So, then only due to this one
and a half thousand views,

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:30.390
this is what I got.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:32.660
And if you look here into the subscribers,

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:34.780
you see that already got
a couple of subscribers,

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:38.340
pretty much 224, only
after this half a month.

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:40.700
And the reason was my promotion strategy

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:41.683
in the very beginning was

00:03:41.683 --> 00:03:44.440
that I was joining Facebook groups.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:45.920
Student Facebook groups,

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:48.350
and there pretty much
promoting the channel.

00:03:48.350 --> 00:03:50.890
Just leaving a little a message
talking about the channel,

00:03:50.890 --> 00:03:53.790
and this really helped
me to get it all going,

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:56.700
to get it started to know
what this is all about.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:04:00.360
So, let's now look into
February, one month further.

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:02.870
How did this develop here again?

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:04.480
Pretty much at this level.

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:05.723
So you see that after some time

00:04:05.723 --> 00:04:09.010
I was at 565 subscribers,

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:10.660
so after one and a half month.

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:13.200
Again my main growth strategy was

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:15.070
the sort of Facebook game,

00:04:15.070 --> 00:04:17.150
just joining Facebook groups,

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:19.300
mainly student groups in Facebook

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.920
and then just talking about it.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:22.273
So let's continue, March.

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:24.820
So again, at some point I stopped

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:26.950
doing all of this with
the Facebook promotions

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.930
and you see that the views also plummeted.

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:31.380
I believe there was a
period of one or two weeks

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:33.750
probably this was this little spike,

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:36.670
where I tried out paid YouTube ads.

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:39.670
So I tried out to set
up a little ad campaign,

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:42.770
wherefore I believe it
was five Euro per day

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:43.900
for a couple of days.

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.650
I was just trying to promote a video,

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:47.440
and just check what that was doing.

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:48.400
But as you can see here

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:50.250
the results were pretty underwhelming.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:51.580
So these are the views.

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:54.460
But if you now compare
this to the subscribers,

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.290
you see that even though
there were some views

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:58.910
I did not get hardly any
subscribers from that.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:00.370
So then also stopped doing it

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:04.000
because I didn't see any
results from it whatsoever.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.520
So this was March.

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:07.480
Now let's move to April.

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:09.510
And here in April now
you see that suddenly

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:13.070
these subscribers start to
increase a bit more organically.

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:14.450
And then end of April was apparently

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:18.210
also when I hit the 1000 subscribers.

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:19.920
If you look into the views
again and you see now

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.310
that suddenly there is a bit of an,

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:24.400
let's see, organic growth going on,

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:28.320
that the views are starting
to slightly increase here

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.660
without me really doing anything.

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.270
Let's look into May.

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:35.620
Again, this trend was
further increasing in May.

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:37.880
Right now you can see that this channel

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:41.070
started kind of to organically
pick up some steam,

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:44.860
pick up some action now, but
still slow and steady growth.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.990
Now there was June.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.150
Let's see how June looked
like and all the views,

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:50.480
the views are now organically

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:52.570
really increasing spiking here.

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:54.510
So very good development,
organic development,

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:57.750
but still of course on a low level.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.040
Now next July.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:03.100
And in July you see that
suddenly there was a spike here,

00:06:03.100 --> 00:06:05.030
suddenly there was a spike in the views.

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:08.150
And this was indeed from this video.

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:10.820
This video, I applied to
McKinsey with this CV,

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:13.330
that really got picked
up by the algorithm.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:16.220
This was the first time that
I really got some traction,

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:18.650
organic traction, from
the YouTube algorithm

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:21.990
that helped to move the whole
channel to the next level.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:23.360
And this was also,

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:27.550
shortly after that I also hit
my 4,000 hours of watch time.

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:28.847
I believe you can see this here,

00:06:28.847 --> 00:06:32.190
so now at this point I was at 5,600.

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:34.120
And as you know, in order to be part

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:35.700
of the YouTube partner program

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:37.890
and be able to earn
some money with YouTube,

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:39.930
you need 4,000 hours of watch time.

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:42.320
So this was pretty much this period

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:43.940
when I made this.

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:46.590
And of course, if you
look into the subscribers

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:49.490
this was also the met by
that one day, peak day,

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:52.530
190 subscribers that I got.

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:56.390
So pretty crazy increase
in the channel growth.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:59.800
But then it got even more
crazy because then in August,

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:01.630
if you look here into the numbers

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:04.500
suddenly there was
another very big movement.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:07.780
So this peak here was the
peak that we saw earlier

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:11.010
and it pretty much almost
connects to right from here.

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:12.690
And what was the reason, again?

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:15.960
It was this video which
performed very, very strongly,

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:18.790
still now the most viewed
video on my channel,

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:20.770
but then also the other two next videos,

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:22.690
especially this video
that was coming next,

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:26.620
also doing very well and then
sustaining this over time.

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:29.620
And this was then really also
met by the subscriber numbers

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:33.770
where I suddenly was jumping
to 32,000 subscribers.

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:35.330
And at the peak there was only one day

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.570
where I got 1,800 subscribers.

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:39.640
And I believe this is
really an important lesson

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:42.110
if you want to understand YouTube growth,

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:45.120
because YouTube growth is
always a step function,

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:47.090
it comes in little explosions.

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:49.050
So yes, there will be
some organic movement

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:51.750
where you slowly accrue
subscribers over time,

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:53.840
But then it just takes this one video,

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:56.470
this one or two videos
that for whatever reason

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:58.340
get picked up by the algorithm,

00:07:58.340 --> 00:08:01.700
and that then catapult your
whole channel to the next level.

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:03.970
And then what is also
typical you can see it here,

00:08:03.970 --> 00:08:07.070
then after some time,
this of course decreases.

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:10.400
After some time your video
was seen by most of the people

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:12.790
who wanted to see, and then YouTube stops

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:13.960
further promoting this.

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:14.880
And now this is of course

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:17.420
a trend that you can see to continue.

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:20.050
If you now look also in the September

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:22.080
if you go one month further,

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:24.190
it all slowly starts to decrease,

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:27.253
to go down again here
also in the subscribers.

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:31.310
And now if we go to October

00:08:31.310 --> 00:08:34.430
you can really see how now
this was back down again.

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:36.290
So this level now here in subscribers,

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:39.440
but here also in views it
significantly decreased.

00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:43.350
Though, of course, while this
level is much lower than this,

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:46.020
if you compare it to
these levels, initially,

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:49.750
of course this is a big
multiple of what was here.

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:51.730
Then of course this will help you to now

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:54.760
pretty much get your
channel to the next level.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:56.730
And then it continued this way.

00:08:56.730 --> 00:08:58.960
Now let's look into
November, what happened here.

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:00.493
Because what you see in
November is that, again,

00:09:00.493 --> 00:09:02.680
here I was lucky and privileged enough

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:05.270
to have another video which
really performed well.

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:08.040
It was this how to take
notes for work video,

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:10.080
which was picked up by
the algorithm again.

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.610
You see here directly the views going up,

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:15.960
you see the subscribers
going up here again.

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:18.280
But again then similar to
what we've seen before,

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.980
this time now even quicker

00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:24.623
that then this was also
decreasing again after some time.

00:09:25.696 --> 00:09:26.680
So, but now end of December,

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:29.950
I was in pretty much 11 and a half months,

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:33.910
at 72 subscribers 0.8 and then the views,

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:35.210
this is also what you see here

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:37.630
is that it is slowing down again.

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:39.130
And now if you look at the very end,

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:42.650
pretty much onto today so
now the latest figures,

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:45.460
you can see that the views are now again

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:47.800
on this lower level where
they are stabilizing.

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:48.820
This is not the new level

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:51.140
which is slightly higher than this level.

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:52.850
So again, I believe the takeaway here

00:09:52.850 --> 00:09:55.830
is that YouTube growth comes in steps.

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:56.800
It's a step function,

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:59.630
only takes one or two
videos to really catapult

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:01.150
your channel to the next level.

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:04.550
And then hopefully after you
come down from that level again

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:06.710
because yes, this will happen as well.

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.610
Then hopefully at the time
your baseline will increase,

00:10:09.610 --> 00:10:11.200
you will stay at a new level

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:15.150
which will establish itself
as the new normal for you.

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:16.780
So my recommendation really is,

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:19.260
if you are thinking about
starting a YouTube channel

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:21.940
do not be discouraged
if in the first months

00:10:21.940 --> 00:10:23.500
you don't see much traction.

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:26.060
So you see this was
really the first half year

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:27.970
where almost nothing happened.

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:30.670
Of course relative to these
peaks that I saw here.

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:32.090
I mean, at the time I was of course

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:35.630
super lucky and super satisfied
with the views that I got.

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:38.520
But now then suddenly it
just takes this first video

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:41.210
which apparently also sent a
good signal to the algorithm.

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:44.450
Then here the next video also
has catapulted it even higher.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:45.760
And then now you're really

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:48.110
in need of these occasional videos

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:49.990
which will really perform well

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:51.400
just to move you up the curve,

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:53.140
to move you to the next level.

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:56.220
So I'm super excited to see
how this growth will continue.

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:58.670
Now over the new year 2021,

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:01.760
I for sure have lots of
great videos planned for you.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.820
I get several messages every single day,

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:05.590
also on Instagram of people telling me

00:11:05.590 --> 00:11:08.100
that they got their job at that Big 4,

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:09.970
at that MBB consulting firm,

00:11:09.970 --> 00:11:12.500
and that they believe that
these videos really helped them.

